---
layout: layout.njk
pagination:
  data: site.interviews
  size: 1
  alias: interview
permalink: '{{ interview.page }}'
eleventyComputed:
  title: '{{ interview.name }}'
  description: '{{ interview.point }}'
---
{%- from "macros.njk" import thingyHead %}
{#- One interview session (content/interviews/session-N.md): Thingy's central point, a rail of the questions (a fold
    on a phone), then each question with its address #qN, Thingy's question, Jamie's answer, and the things it is
    about as tags. The two faces carry the speakers' names as alt text. The transcript is Jamie's words and keeps its
    emphasis, like a thing's story. A correction of Thingy's sits under the answer and leaves the answer where it is. #}
{%- macro questionLinks(interview) %}
{% for q in interview.questions %}<a class="toc-link" href="#q{{ q.n }}"><b>{{ q.n }}</b><span>{{ q.title }}</span></a>
{% endfor %}<a class="toc-link toc-about" href="#about">About this session</a>
<a class="toc-link" href="{{ interview.markdown }}">Read as Markdown</a>
{% endmacro -%}
<article class="session">
  <header class="session-top">
    <span class="session-number" aria-hidden="true">{{ interview.session }}</span>
    <div class="session-what">
      <p class="meta"><a href="/interviews/">Interviews</a> · Session {{ interview.session }} · {{ interview.started | date }} · {{ interview.questions | length }} questions</p>
      <h1>{{ interview.title }}</h1>
      <div class="thingy-box">{{ thingyHead("") }}<b>Thingy</b><p class="thingy-says lede">{{ interview.point }}</p></div>
    </div>
    <a class="thingy-companion" href="/things/thingy-model/" aria-label="Meet Thingy’s character"><img src="https://thingy.thingelstad.xyz/character/latest/poses/workshop-present.webp" width="170" height="170" alt="Thingy, the Workshop Builder, presenting a laptop" /></a>
  </header>
  <details class="toc-fold">
    <summary><span>Questions {{ interview.questions[0].n }} to {{ interview.questions[interview.questions.length - 1].n }}</span><span class="muted">Jump</span></summary>
    <nav aria-label="Questions in this session">{{ questionLinks(interview) }}</nav>
  </details>
  <div class="contents-grid">
    <nav class="toc" id="questions" aria-label="Questions in this session" data-toc>
      <p class="label">Questions {{ interview.questions[0].n }} to {{ interview.questions[interview.questions.length - 1].n }}</p>
      {{ questionLinks(interview) }}
    </nav>
    <div class="session-main">
      <div class="transcript" id="transcript">
        {% for q in interview.questions %}
        <section class="question" id="q{{ q.n }}">
          <h2><a class="question-number" href="#q{{ q.n }}" aria-label="Link to question {{ q.n }}">{{ q.n }}</a><span>{{ q.title }}</span></h2>
          <div class="turn turn-thingy">{{ thingyHead("Thingy") }}<div class="turn-words"><p>{{ q.question | mdInline | safe }}</p></div></div>
          {% for turn in q.turns %}
          <div class="turn turn-{{ turn.who }}">
            {% if turn.who == 'jamie' %}<img class="turn-face" src="{{ owner.avatar }}" alt="Jamie" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy" />{% else %}{{ thingyHead("Thingy") }}{% endif %}
            <div class="turn-words">{% if turn.who == 'correction' %}<p class="turn-label">Thingy’s correction</p>{% endif %}
              {{ turn.text | md | safe }}
            </div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
          {% if q.things | length %}<p class="question-things">{% for thing in q.things %}<a class="tag" href="{{ thing.page }}">{{ thing.title }}</a> {% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}
        </section>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <section class="session-about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-this-session">
        <h2 id="about-this-session">About this session</h2>
        <p>Jamie answered out loud on {{ interview.started | date }}. I asked the questions and wrote the point at the top. His answers are his own words, lightly edited because speech and writing are different things. Where I have added a fact to one, it is marked as mine and it says where the fact came from.</p>
        {% if interview.notes | length %}<ul>
          {% for note in interview.notes %}<li>{{ note }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>{% endif %}
        <p class="meta"><a href="{{ site.repository }}/blob/main/content/interviews/{{ interview.id }}.md">The transcript file</a></p>
      </section>
      <nav class="session-others" aria-label="Other sessions">
        {% if interview.previous %}<a href="{{ interview.previous.page }}"><span class="meta">Session {{ interview.previous.session }}</span><b>← {{ interview.previous.title }}</b></a>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
        <a class="more" href="/interviews/">All sessions</a>
        {% if interview.next %}<a class="is-next" href="{{ interview.next.page }}"><span class="meta">Session {{ interview.next.session }}</span><b>{{ interview.next.title }} →</b></a>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
<script type="module" src="{{ assets.enhance }}"></script>
